{"3844910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Historic Helix", "steam_appid": 3844910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Note: This Historic Helix project is Regularly Updated Based on Player Feedback</u></i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt the Six &quot;Super Artifacts&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historic Helix is a top-down action-adventure built around exploration, instant progression, and route choice. Expand a treasure map overworld, enter new levels, collect artifacts that upgrade you on pickup, and track down six major relics tied to the Helix project, changing how you move, fight, and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.poster.avif?t=1777065903\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.webm?t=1777065903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Growing Treasure Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fragment reveals more of the world and pushes the project forward. Open new pins, uncover shortcuts, and choose where to go next across deserts, deep seas, icy paths, jungles, and stranger places beyond them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/9d9ff9307e9de8445521b00fc0de18b3.poster.avif?t=1777065903\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/9d9ff9307e9de8445521b00fc0de18b3.webm?t=1777065903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade by Playing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery feels like progress on the Helix project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/961d2c602e586791751085f49a86621e.poster.avif?t=1777065903\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/961d2c602e586791751085f49a86621e.webm?t=1777065903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Route</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path that looks safest, hardest, richest, or weirdest. Different route orders change the pace of progression, the challenges you face, and how the project unfolds on the way to each Super Artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/3c10dcb5a7e9dbdb18f44105b79b783a.poster.avif?t=1777065903\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/3c10dcb5a7e9dbdb18f44105b79b783a.webm?t=1777065903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore in the Details</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts unlock stories, memories, and clues tied to the places you explore. Dig deep into the mystery behind the Helix project, or stay focused on the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.poster.avif?t=1777065903\" width=1074 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.webm?t=1777065903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top-Down Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst through hazards with Surge, hold your ground with Rage, and master enemies, chambers, shortcuts, and boss encounters as the Helix becomes stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.poster.avif?t=1777065903\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.webm?t=1777065903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.poster.avif?t=1777065903\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.webm?t=1777065903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soundtrack That Grows With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music &amp; Sound Effects shifts with movement, progress, and momentum to make each area and collectable feel more alive as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" p